Files in this repository adapted from mlx-serve:

    Sources/MCEngine/EngineSupervisor.swift
        Lifecycle (spawn, readiness poll, crash classification, backoff), from
        app/Sources/MLXServe/Services/ServerManager.swift.
    Sources/MCEngine/CrashClassifier.swift
        Crash summarizing, from app/Sources/MLXServe/Services/ServerManager.swift.
    Sources/MCEngine/PidFile.swift
        Process-exit waiting (waitForExit), from
        app/Sources/MLXServe/Services/ServerManager.swift.
    Sources/MCEnhancer/PromptEnhancer.swift, Sources/MCEnhancer/PromptPack.swift,
    Sources/MCEnhancer/Resources/Packs/
        Prompt-pack structure (a shape instruction per family, example pairs, and a reply-with-only-the-prompt
        rule), following app/Sources/MLXServe/Services/PromptRewriter.swift at v26.10.2. The pack text is written
        for this application and no upstream text is copied. That file carries no license header; the upstream
        repository is MIT licensed (LICENSE at v26.10.2, Copyright (c) 2026 David Dalcu), covered by the terms above.

